    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9188" root="حمل" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَامِلَةٌ</span></b>  fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَامِلٌ</span> [q. v.]. (S, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 

<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوَامِلُ</span> is its pl.: and signifies The <i>legs;</i> (M,
K;) because they bear the man. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
The <i>sinews,</i> or <i>tendons,</i> of the foot and of the fore
arm; (M, K;) and the [<i>veins called the</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوَاهِش</span>
thereof. (M, TA. [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الوَرِيدُ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْمِلٌ</span>.

